rotag (unreleased)

  * Fixed the absence of cutoff function when calculating with 'rotag_energy'
    script.
  * Added the option to calculate pairwise interactions between side-chains.
  * Added 'rotag_angle' script that calculates angle between two bonds.
  * Added 'rotag_length' script that calculates length between two atoms.
  * Added 'rotag_mutate' script that can add or replace molecular moieties.
  * Added 'rotag_connect' script that can be used to connect atoms by creating
    or modifying '_struct_conn' mmCIF loop.
  * Added a capability to include heteroatoms in rotamer scanning and related
    calculations.
  * Added a pairwise option to the 'rotag_scan' script in order to remove
    rotamers that have no compatible conformations with surrounding rotamers.
  * Added an option to randomly select rotamer angles in 'rotag_scan' script.
  * Added an option to cluster heteroatoms using DBSCAN algorithm in 'rotag_add'
    script.
  * Updated force field parameters by including MG, CA, NA, ZN, K, CD ions and
    water molecule.
  * Improved unique residue key description by adding '_atom_site.auth_seq_id',
    '_atom_site.auth_asym_id' and 'pdbx_auth_alt_id' for accommodating
    unique selection of heteroatoms.

rotag (0.1.2)

  * Added a capability to control the angle step size and range while scanning
    rotamer dihedral angles.

rotag (0.1.1)

  * Added check on presence of mandatory residue atoms for rotamer scanning
    calculations.

rotag (0.1.0)

  * Initial release.
